{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01TESGwfX1ep9vqKKzuxq2Zv","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Paper Framing — symb_invariant_consensus\n2\t\n3\t## Target Venue\n4\t- Primary: EMNLP 2026 Main (ARR May 25)\n5\t- Fallback: AAAI 2027 (Aug 1)\n6\t- Deadline: May 25, 2026 (ARR submission)\n7\t\n8\t## Core Claims (3 条)\n9\t1. **Principled Tiebreaking**: SICA resolves Self-Consistency voting ties through symbolic constraint weighting, achieving higher accuracy than arbitrary tiebreak rules on logic reasoning benchmarks (FOLIO +6.7pp, combined +3.3pp on 60 questions; target: statistically significant on 200+ questions).\n10\t2. **Operating Regime Characterization**: The effectiveness of symbolic consensus is conditional on trace diversity — SICA adds value when model outputs are diverse (instruction models, C0>20%) but provably degenerates to SC when models are self-consistent (reasoning models, C0<5%). This is a model property, not a task property.\n11\t3. **C0 as Practical Diagnostic**: Multi-candidate rate (C0) serves as a zero-cost predictor of whether SICA deployment will yield gains over SC, enabling practitioners to decide without running full symbolic analysis.\n12\t\n13\t## Core Insight\n14\tSymbolic constraint consensus doesn't uniformly improve reasoning — it specifically helps when there IS disagreement to resolve. We provide the first systematic study of WHEN symbolic consensus adds value, revealing that model architecture (reasoning vs instruction) determines the operating regime. This transforms SICA from \"yet another ensemble method\" into \"a method with formally characterizable applicability boundaries.\"\n15\t\n16\t## Story Spine\n17\t- **Problem**: Self-Consistency (SC) aggregates LLM reasoning paths via majority voting but treats all chains as opaque votes, discarding the logical structure within them. When votes are tied, SC falls back to arbitrary rules (alphabetical, random) with no principled resolution.\n18\t- **Existing approaches & gaps**: SC (Wang et al. 2023) — pure voting, no reasoning structure. USC (Chen et al. 2023) — universal SC, still voting-based. None exploit the formal logical structure within reasoning traces for consensus, and none characterize when symbolic methods help vs. don't.\n19\t- **Our framing**: SICA extracts first-order logic constraints from reasoning traces and uses weighted partial MAX-SAT to find the globally consistent answer. We show this provides principled tiebreaking (75% win rate on ties vs 25% for SC) but only when trace diversity exists. We formalize this as C0 (multi-candidate rate) and show it's governed by model type, not task type.\n20\t- **Headline result template**: \"On FOLIO, SICA achieves 80.0% vs SC's 73.3% (+6.7pp) with Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct. On the same benchmarks with QwQ-32B, SICA degenerates to SC (C0=3.6%), revealing that symbolic consensus effectiveness is governed by trace diversity, not task difficulty.\"\n21\t\n22\t## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns & Defensive Experiments\n23\t1. **\"Gains not statistically significant\"** → exp-001: Expand to 200+ questions for statistical power\n24\t2. **\"Only a better tiebreaker, not worth the overhead\"** → exp-002: K sensitivity showing benefit pattern; exp-009: overhead analysis\n25\t3. **\"Only one non-reasoning model\"** → exp-004: Add Qwen2.5-7B for scaling; exp-007: 72B-AWQ for camera-ready\n26\t4. **\"ProofWriter shows 0pp gain\"** → Domain analysis in exp-001 expanded results\n27\t5. **\"Random tiebreak baseline closes the gap\"** → exp-003: Direct SICA vs SC-random vs SC-deterministic comparison\n28\t6. **\"Why not just use a reasoning model?\"** → exp-005: QwQ-32B data shows reasoning models are self-consistent (don't need consensus improvement), but instruction models (cheaper, more deployed) benefit from SICA\n29\t\n30\t## Venue Fit Risks\n31\t- EMNLP: Contribution may feel narrow if framed as ONLY tiebreaking. Primary intellectual contribution is the \"operating regime characterization\" — the tiebreaking mechanism is evidence, not the claim.\n32\t- Cross-discipline: Combines formal logic (MAX-SAT) with NLP (LLM reasoning). MAX-SAT needs clear explanation for NLP audience.\n33\t- Negative results: QwQ-32B data must be presented as insight (\"When Does Symbolic Consensus Degenerate?\"), not failure.\n34\t- Statistical power: 60-question results are fragile. 200+ question expansion is prerequisite for credible submission.\n35\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5d4d05df-e774-4096-8b7e-576c0487978c","uuid":"b372d3c9-e3dc-4faa-a97d-37e09fc75c5d","timestamp":"2026-05-16T06:10:35.598Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0513_3/projects/symb_invariant_consensus/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260516T054054/worst/paper_framing.md","content":"# Paper Framing — symb_invariant_consensus\n\n## Target Venue\n- Primary: EMNLP 2026 Main (ARR May 25)\n- Fallback: AAAI 2027 (Aug 1)\n- Deadline: May 25, 2026 (ARR submission)\n\n## Core Claims (3 条)\n1. **Principled Tiebreaking**: SICA resolves Self-Consistency voting ties through symbolic constraint weighting, achieving higher accuracy than arbitrary tiebreak rules on logic reasoning benchmarks (FOLIO +6.7pp, combined +3.3pp on 60 questions; target: statistically significant on 200+ questions).\n2. **Operating Regime Characterization**: The effectiveness of symbolic consensus is conditional on trace diversity — SICA adds value when model outputs are diverse (instruction models, C0>20%) but provably degenerates to SC when models are self-consistent (reasoning models, C0<5%). This is a model property, not a task property.\n3. **C0 as Practical Diagnostic**: Multi-candidate rate (C0) serves as a zero-cost predictor of whether SICA deployment will yield gains over SC, enabling practitioners to decide without running full symbolic analysis.\n\n## Core Insight\nSymbolic constraint consensus doesn't uniformly improve reasoning — it specifically helps when there IS disagreement to resolve. We provide the first systematic study of WHEN symbolic consensus adds value, revealing that model architecture (reasoning vs instruction) determines the operating regime. This transforms SICA from \"yet another ensemble method\" into \"a method with formally characterizable applicability boundaries.\"\n\n## Story Spine\n- **Problem**: Self-Consistency (SC) aggregates LLM reasoning paths via majority voting but treats all chains as opaque votes, discarding the logical structure within them. When votes are tied, SC falls back to arbitrary rules (alphabetical, random) with no principled resolution.\n- **Existing approaches & gaps**: SC (Wang et al. 2023) — pure voting, no reasoning structure. USC (Chen et al. 2023) — universal SC, still voting-based. None exploit the formal logical structure within reasoning traces for consensus, and none characterize when symbolic methods help vs. don't.\n- **Our framing**: SICA extracts first-order logic constraints from reasoning traces and uses weighted partial MAX-SAT to find the globally consistent answer. We show this provides principled tiebreaking (75% win rate on ties vs 25% for SC) but only when trace diversity exists. We formalize this as C0 (multi-candidate rate) and show it's governed by model type, not task type.\n- **Headline result template**: \"On FOLIO, SICA achieves 80.0% vs SC's 73.3% (+6.7pp) with Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct. On the same benchmarks with QwQ-32B, SICA degenerates to SC (C0=3.6%), revealing that symbolic consensus effectiveness is governed by trace diversity, not task difficulty.\"\n\n## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns & Defensive Experiments\n1. **\"Gains not statistically significant\"** → exp-001: Expand to 200+ questions for statistical power\n2. **\"Only a better tiebreaker, not worth the overhead\"** → exp-002: K sensitivity showing benefit pattern; exp-009: overhead analysis\n3. **\"Only one non-reasoning model\"** → exp-004: Add Qwen2.5-7B for scaling; exp-007: 72B-AWQ for camera-ready\n4. **\"ProofWriter shows 0pp gain\"** → Domain analysis in exp-001 expanded results\n5. **\"Random tiebreak baseline closes the gap\"** → exp-003: Direct SICA vs SC-random vs SC-deterministic comparison\n6. **\"Why not just use a reasoning model?\"** → exp-005: QwQ-32B data shows reasoning models are self-consistent (don't need consensus improvement), but instruction models (cheaper, more deployed) benefit from SICA\n\n## Venue Fit Risks\n- EMNLP: Contribution may feel narrow if framed as ONLY tiebreaking. Primary intellectual contribution is the \"operating regime characterization\" — the tiebreaking mechanism is evidence, not the claim.\n- Cross-discipline: Combines formal logic (MAX-SAT) with NLP (LLM reasoning). MAX-SAT needs clear explanation for NLP audience.\n- Negative results: QwQ-32B data must be presented as insight (\"When Does Symbolic Consensus Degenerate?\"), not failure.\n- Statistical power: 60-question results are fragile. 200+ question expansion is prerequisite for credible submission.\n","numLines":35,"startLine":1,"totalLines":35}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0181MRmeyDHVMtC2dihe7hWX","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t[\n2\t  {\n3\t    \"name\": \"sica_expanded_14b\",\n4\t    \"description\": \"PW D5 600 + FOLIO 204 = 804 questions, K=12, T=0.7, Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct\",\n5\t    \"results\": {\n6\t      \"sica_accuracy_combined\": 0.695,\n7\t      \"sc_accuracy_combined\": 0.688,\n8\t      \"sica_sc_gap_combined_pp\": 0.7,\n9\t      \"folio_sica_accuracy\": 0.755,\n10\t      \"folio_sc_accuracy\": 0.735,\n11\t      \"folio_gap_pp\": 2.0,\n12\t      \"proofwriter_sica_accuracy\": 0.665,\n13\t      \"proofwriter_sc_accuracy\": 0.67,\n14\t      \"proofwriter_gap_pp\": -0.5,\n15\t      \"bootstrap_p_combined\": 0.32,\n16\t      \"bootstrap_p_folio\": 0.18,\n17\t      \"c0_combined\": 0.28,\n18\t      \"c0_folio\": 0.32,\n19\t      \"c0_proofwriter\": 0.25,\n20\t      \"maxsat_exclusion_rate\": 0.022,\n21\t      \"tie_question_fraction\": 0.025,\n22\t      \"tiebreak_triggered_n\": \"~20\",\n23\t      \"tiebreak_win_rate\": 0.6,\n24\t      \"wall_time_hours\": \"~13\"\n25\t    },\n26\t    \"tables\": [\n27\t      {\n28\t        \"name\": \"Table 2: Expanded Results (804 Questions)\",\n29\t        \"columns\": [\n30\t          \"Domain\",\n31\t          \"N\",\n32\t          \"SC Acc\",\n33\t          \"SICA Acc\",\n34\t          \"Gap (pp)\",\n35\t          \"C0\",\n36\t          \"Ties\",\n37\t          \"p-value\"\n38\t        ],\n39\t        \"rows\": [\n40\t          [\n41\t            \"FOLIO\",\n42\t            204,\n43\t            \"73.5%\",\n44\t            \"75.5%\",\n45\t            \"+2.0\",\n46\t            \"0.32\",\n47\t            \"6 (2.9%)\",\n48\t            \"0.18\"\n49\t          ],\n50\t          [\n51\t            \"ProofWriter D5\",\n52\t            600,\n53\t            \"67.0%\",\n54\t            \"66.5%\",\n55\t            \"-0.5\",\n56\t            \"0.25\",\n57\t            \"14 (2.3%)\",\n58\t            \"0.71\"\n59\t          ],\n60\t          [\n61\t            \"Combined\",\n62\t            804,\n63\t            \"68.8%\",\n64\t            \"69.5%\",\n65\t            \"+0.7\",\n66\t            \"0.28\",\n67\t            \"20 (2.5%)\",\n68\t            \"0.32\"\n69\t          ],\n70\t          [\n71\t            \"D012 (reference)\",\n72\t            60,\n73\t            \"70.0%\",\n74\t            \"73.3%\",\n75\t            \"+3.3\",\n76\t            \"0.53\",\n77\t            \"4 (6.7%)\",\n78\t            \"0.23\"\n79\t          ]\n80\t        ]\n81\t      }\n82\t    ],\n83\t    \"figures\": [],\n84\t    \"analysis\": \"关键发现：60题D012样本的C0=53%是selection bias——那60题本身就是从pilot中挑出的 有趣/困难题目。扩展到完整benchmark后，绝大多数题对14B-Instruct而言diversity不足。 SICA的正确性在tie scenario中得到验证（60% win rate > 25% random baseline）， 但tie场景太少（2.5%）导致aggregate gain不显著。 这直接支持reframe：方法正确但operating regime狭窄。\\n\\n\\n60题的C0=53%严重高估了总体diversity。扩展至804题后，大量ProofWriter D5题目对14B而言 要么太简单（12/12一致正确）要么模式化错误（12/12一致错误），C0降至25-28%。 FOLIO 204题中约32%有多候选，但多数多候选题的split是9:3或10:2而非6:6， MaxSAT在非tie情况下几乎不改变majority结果（exclusion rate仅2.2%）。 真正的6:6 tie在K=12下约占2.5%（~20题），tiebreak在这20题上win rate约60%， 贡献约0.7pp的combined gap。ProofWriter因其closed-world逻辑的规律性， 14B在大样本上反而因constraint extraction引入微量噪声导致-0.5pp。 Bootstrap p=0.32远未达显著性，confirm了小样本噪声假设。\\n\"\n85\t  },\n86\t  {\n87\t    \"name\": \"sica_k_ablation_14b\",\n88\t    \"description\": \"K=6,8,12,16,20 on D012's 60 questions, T=0.7, Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct\",\n89\t    \"results\": {\n90\t      \"k6_gap_pp\": 1.7,\n91\t      \"k6_c0\": 0.4,\n92\t      \"k6_tie_fraction\": 0.033,\n93\t      \"k8_gap_pp\": 0.0,\n94\t      \"k8_c0\": 0.45,\n95\t      \"k8_tie_fraction\": 0.017,\n96\t      \"k12_gap_pp\": 3.3,\n97\t      \"k12_c0\": 0.53,\n98\t      \"k12_tie_fraction\": 0.067,\n99\t      \"k16_gap_pp\": 1.7,\n100\t      \"k16_c0\": 0.55,\n101\t      \"k16_tie_fraction\": 0.033,\n102\t      \"k20_gap_pp\": 0.0,\n103\t      \"k20_c0\": 0.58,\n104\t      \"k20_tie_fraction\": 0.017,\n105\t      \"best_k\": 12,\n106\t      \"best_gap_pp\": 3.3,\n107\t      \"odd_k_gap_pp\": 0.0,\n108\t      \"correlation_c0_gap\": 0.35\n109\t    },\n110\t    \"tables\": [\n111\t      {\n112\t        \"name\": \"Table 3: K Sensitivity Analysis\",\n113\t        \"columns\": [\n114\t          \"K\",\n115\t          \"C0\",\n116\t          \"Tie Fraction\",\n117\t          \"SICA Acc\",\n118\t          \"SC Acc\",\n119\t          \"Gap (pp)\",\n120\t          \"Exclusion Rate\"\n121\t        ],\n122\t        \"rows\": [\n123\t          [\n124\t            6,\n125\t            \"40%\",\n126\t            \"3.3%\",\n127\t            \"71.7%\",\n128\t            \"70.0%\",\n129\t            \"+1.7\",\n130\t            \"2.8%\"\n131\t          ],\n132\t          [\n133\t            8,\n134\t            \"45%\",\n135\t            \"1.7%\",\n136\t            \"70.0%\",\n137\t            \"70.0%\",\n138\t            \"0.0\",\n139\t            \"2.5%\"\n140\t          ],\n141\t          [\n142\t            12,\n143\t            \"53%\",\n144\t            \"6.7%\",\n145\t            \"73.3%\",\n146\t            \"70.0%\",\n147\t            \"+3.3\",\n148\t            \"2.6%\"\n149\t          ],\n150\t          [\n151\t            16,\n152\t            \"55%\",\n153\t            \"3.3%\",\n154\t            \"71.7%\",\n155\t            \"70.0%\",\n156\t            \"+1.7\",\n157\t            \"2.4%\"\n158\t          ],\n159\t          [\n160\t            20,\n161\t            \"58%\",\n162\t            \"1.7%\",\n163\t            \"70.0%\",\n164\t            \"70.0%\",\n165\t            \"0.0\",\n166\t            \"2.2%\"\n167\t          ]\n168\t        ]\n169\t      }\n170\t    ],\n171\t    \"figures\": [],\n172\t    \"analysis\": \"K ablation是worst档的核心evidence：它证明SICA gain完全由tie frequency决定， 而非由constraint quality或MaxSAT reasoning决定。C0和gap的相关性仅0.35， 因为C0测量的是diversity存在性，而gain需要diversity恰好50:50。 这支持reframe中的\\\"method is correct but regime is narrow\\\"论点。 Paper中应呈现为\\\"SICA's mechanism activates only at exact vote parity\\\"。\\n\\n\\nK ablation在worst档下揭示SICA gain完全是tie-driven artifact： - K=12恰好是唯一在这60题上产生较多even-split tie的值（4题=6.7%） - K=6时tie需要3:3，概率更低但发生1-2次；K=8需要4:4，几乎不发生 - K=16/20时，larger sample使majority更稳定，tie概率指数下降 - C0随K单调增加（更多samples→更可能出现minority answer），但tie fraction\\n  不单调——它取决于specific split概率\\n- 如果测试odd K（K=7,9,11），tie在majority voting下数学上不可能，gap=0 这证明SICA的gain机制是且仅是tiebreaking，没有通过constraint weighting 在非tie场景改变outcome。MaxSAT exclusion在所有K下都<3%， 从未翻转过一个non-tie majority。\\n\"\n173\t  },\n174\t  {\n175\t    \"name\": \"tiebreak_baseline_analysis\",\n176\t    \"description\": \"SICA vs SC-random vs SC-deterministic on all available data (exp-001 results)\",\n177\t    \"results\": {\n178\t      \"expanded_tie_questions_n\": 20,\n179\t      \"sica_tiebreak_accuracy\": 0.6,\n180\t      \"random_tiebreak_expected_accuracy\": 0.5,\n181\t      \"alphabetical_tiebreak_accuracy\": 0.45,\n182\t      \"first_seen_tiebreak_accuracy\": 0.4,\n183\t      \"sica_vs_random_gap_on_ties_pp\": 10.0,\n184\t      \"sica_vs_random_gap_overall_pp\": 0.25,\n185\t      \"binomial_p_sica_vs_random\": 0.25\n186\t    },\n187\t    \"tables\": [\n188\t      {\n189\t        \"name\": \"Table 4: Tiebreak Strategy Comparison (Tie Questions Only)\",\n190\t        \"columns\": [\n191\t          \"Strategy\",\n192\t          \"Acc on Ties (N=20)\",\n193\t          \"Overall Acc (N=804)\",\n194\t          \"vs Random (pp)\"\n195\t        ],\n196\t        \"rows\": [\n197\t          [\n198\t            \"SICA (MaxSAT weighted)\",\n199\t            \"60.0%\",\n200\t            \"69.5%\",\n201\t            \"+0.25\"\n202\t          ],\n203\t          [\n204\t            \"Random (expected)\",\n205\t            \"50.0%\",\n206\t            \"69.3%\",\n207\t            \"—\"\n208\t          ],\n209\t          [\n210\t            \"Alphabetical\",\n211\t            \"45.0%\",\n212\t            \"69.1%\",\n213\t            \"-0.12\"\n214\t          ],\n215\t          [\n216\t            \"First-seen\",\n217\t            \"40.0%\",\n218\t            \"69.0%\",\n219\t            \"-0.25\"\n220\t          ]\n221\t        ]\n222\t      }\n223\t    ],\n224\t    \"figures\": [],\n225\t    \"analysis\": \"Tiebreak analysis在worst档下支撑的narrative是：SICA作为tiebreak mechanism 方向正确（优于random和deterministic），但operating regime（tie frequency=2.5%） 使其对aggregate performance的贡献可以忽略。 Paper framing：不claim accuracy gain，而是用tiebreak win rate作为 \\\"symbolic constraints carry real information\\\"的evidence，然后pivot到 \\\"but the regime where this information matters is vanishingly narrow for current models\\\"。\\n\\n\\n在expanded 804题上，tie仅~20题。SICA在这20题上60% accuracy（12/20正确）， random baseline期望50%（10/20），差距仅2题。Binomial test p=0.25（20次试验中 观察12+ success vs null=0.5），远不显著。 虽然per-tie的win rate（60%>50%）方向正确，但： (1) 样本太小无法统计确认优势 (2) 即使优势真实，对overall accuracy贡献仅0.25pp（20题×10%÷804题） Alphabetical/first-seen表现更差验证了\\\"任意tiebreak确实有害\\\"，但SICA的优势 幅度太小且统计不显著。这是\\\"correct but narrow\\\"的直接数字化呈现。\\n\"\n226\t  },\n227\t  {\n228\t    \"name\": \"sica_7b_scaling\",\n229\t    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct on same 60 questions, K=12, T=0.7\",\n230\t    \"results\": {\n231\t      \"sc_accuracy\": 0.583,\n232\t      \"sica_accuracy\": 0.6,\n233\t      \"sica_sc_gap_pp\": 1.7,\n234\t      \"c0_multi_candidate_rate\": 0.65,\n235\t      \"tie_fraction\": 0.1,\n236\t      \"tiebreak_win_rate\": 0.5,\n237\t      \"maxsat_exclusion_rate\": 0.018,\n238\t      \"constraint_quality_score\": 0.45,\n239\t      \"extraction_failure_rate\": 0.12\n240\t    },\n241\t    \"tables\": [\n242\t      {\n243\t        \"name\": \"Table 5: Model Scaling and C0\",\n244\t        \"columns\": [\n245\t          \"Model\",\n246\t          \"Params\",\n247\t          \"SC Acc\",\n248\t          \"C0\",\n249\t          \"Tie%\",\n250\t          \"Tiebreak WR\",\n251\t          \"Gap (pp)\"\n252\t        ],\n253\t        \"rows\": [\n254\t          [\n255\t            \"QwQ-32B\",\n256\t            \"32B (reasoning)\",\n257\t            \"72.7%\",\n258\t            \"0.036\",\n259\t            \"0%\",\n260\t            \"N/A\",\n261\t            \"0.0\"\n262\t          ],\n263\t          [\n264\t            \"Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct\",\n265\t            \"14B\",\n266\t            \"70.0%\",\n267\t            \"0.53\",\n268\t            \"6.7%\",\n269\t            \"75%\",\n270\t            \"+3.3\"\n271\t          ],\n272\t          [\n273\t            \"Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct\",\n274\t            \"7B\",\n275\t            \"58.3%\",\n276\t            \"0.65\",\n277\t            \"10%\",\n278\t            \"50%\",\n279\t            \"+1.7\"\n280\t          ]\n281\t        ]\n282\t      }\n283\t    ],\n284\t    \"figures\": [],\n285\t    \"analysis\": \"7B结果在worst档下是double-edged：一方面验证了C0与model type的关系（weaker→more diverse）， 另一方面破坏了C0作为单一predictor的简洁narrative。需要引入constraint quality 作为second axis，使C0 diagnostic framework从\\\"单指标预测\\\"退化为\\\"必要条件判断\\\"。 对reframed paper仍有价值：强化了\\\"operating regime is narrow\\\"的结论—— 不仅需要diversity，还需要diversity来自有能力产生valid constraints的模型。\\n\\n\\n7B模型验证了C0-as-predictor的方向性（C0=65% > 14B的53%），但在worst档下 暴露了C0的insufficiency：更高的diversity不一定转化为更大的SICA gain。 原因：7B的constraint extraction质量显著下降——更弱的模型生成的reasoning traces 逻辑结构更松散，extracted FOL constraints更多是malformed或语义空洞的， MaxSAT weighting基于低质量constraints做出的决策不比random好。 Tie fraction确实更高（10% vs 6.7%），但tiebreak win rate降至chance level（50%）， 因为constraint信号被noise淹没。最终gap仅1.7pp且完全不显著。 这对paper的贡献：C0是necessary but not sufficient condition—— 还需要constraint quality（隐含model capability threshold）。\\n\"\n286\t  },\n287\t  {\n288\t    \"name\": \"qwq_32b_operating_regime\",\n289\t    \"description\": \"QwQ-32B existing data formatted for operating regime analysis\",\n290\t    \"results\": {\n291\t      \"aime_c0\": 0.0,\n292\t      \"aime_sica_sc_gap\": 0.0,\n293\t      \"folio_c0\": 0.0,\n294\t      \"folio_sica_sc_gap\": 0.0,\n295\t      \"proofwriter_c0\": 0.1875,\n296\t      \"proofwriter_sica_sc_gap\": 0.0,\n297\t      \"combined_c0\": 0.036,\n298\t      \"combined_sica_sc_gap\": 0.0,\n299\t      \"n_total\": 48,\n300\t      \"reasoning_model_conclusion\": \"SICA structurally degenerates to SC\"\n301\t    },\n302\t    \"tables\": [\n303\t      {\n304\t        \"name\": \"Table 6: Reasoning vs Instruction Model Operating Regime\",\n305\t        \"columns\": [\n306\t          \"Model\",\n307\t          \"Type\",\n308\t          \"Domain\",\n309\t          \"N\",\n310\t          \"C0\",\n311\t          \"SICA-SC Gap\"\n312\t        ],\n313\t        \"rows\": [\n314\t          [\n315\t            \"QwQ-32B\",\n316\t            \"Reasoning\",\n317\t            \"AIME\",\n318\t            22,\n319\t            \"0%\",\n320\t            \"0.0pp\"\n321\t          ],\n322\t          [\n323\t            \"QwQ-32B\",\n324\t            \"Reasoning\",\n325\t            \"FOLIO\",\n326\t            10,\n327\t            \"0%\",\n328\t            \"0.0pp\"\n329\t          ],\n330\t          [\n331\t            \"QwQ-32B\",\n332\t            \"Reasoning\",\n333\t            \"ProofWriter\",\n334\t            16,\n335\t            \"18.75%\",\n336\t            \"0.0pp\"\n337\t          ],\n338\t          [\n339\t            \"Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct\",\n340\t            \"Instruction\",\n341\t            \"FOLIO\",\n342\t            30,\n343\t            \"40%\",\n344\t            \"+6.7pp\"\n345\t          ],\n346\t          [\n347\t            \"Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct\",\n348\t            \"Instruction\",\n349\t            \"ProofWriter\",\n350\t            30,\n351\t            \"63%\",\n352\t            \"0.0pp\"\n353\t          ],\n354\t          [\n355\t            \"Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct\",\n356\t            \"Instruction\",\n357\t            \"Combined\",\n358\t            60,\n359\t            \"53%\",\n360\t            \"+3.3pp\"\n361\t          ]\n362\t        ]\n363\t      }\n364\t    ],\n365\t    \"figures\": [],\n366\t    \"analysis\": \"QwQ data在worst档下从\\\"negative result配角\\\"升为\\\"主要贡献\\\"。 Framing：不是\\\"SICA在reasoning model上失败\\\"，而是\\\"我们发现了一个fundamental architectural property——reasoning models的internal self-consistency消除了 external consensus的操作空间\\\"。这个发现对ALL ensemble/consensus methods成立， 不限于SICA，是architecturally general的insight。 Paper中应作为Section 4的opening，建立\\\"operating regime\\\"概念后再展示14B数据。\\n\\n\\nQwQ数据已存在且确认worst档预设：reasoning model的chain-of-thought过程 产生near-deterministic答案（temperature sampling无法穿透reasoning chain的 self-correction机制）。C0=3.6%意味着在48题中仅1-2题出现过多候选答案， 且这些多候选情况可能是reasoning chain的中间犹豫而非genuine uncertainty。 SICA≡SC是数学必然：当只有1个candidate answer时，MaxSAT无论怎么weight都选它。 这是worst档narrative的strongest evidence——\\\"method correctness is irrelevant  when the operating regime doesn't exist\\\"。\\n\"\n367\t  },\n368\t  {\n369\t    \"name\": \"c0_diagnostic_validation\",\n370\t    \"description\": \"Plot C0 vs SICA-SC gap across all models and K values\",\n371\t    \"results\": {\n372\t      \"n_datapoints\": 12,\n373\t      \"pearson_r_c0_gap\": 0.45,\n374\t      \"spearman_rho_c0_gap\": 0.52,\n375\t      \"c0_threshold_for_positive_gap\": 0.3,\n376\t      \"false_positive_rate\": 0.25,\n377\t      \"false_negative_rate\": 0.1,\n378\t      \"auc_c0_as_classifier\": 0.72\n379\t    },\n380\t    \"tables\": [\n381\t      {\n382\t        \"name\": \"Table 7: C0 as Diagnostic — Correlation Analysis\",\n383\t        \"columns\": [\n384\t          \"Condition\",\n385\t          \"C0\",\n386\t          \"Gap (pp)\",\n387\t          \"N\"\n388\t        ],\n389\t        \"rows\": [\n390\t          [\n391\t            \"QwQ-32B Combined\",\n392\t            0.036,\n393\t            0.0,\n394\t            48\n395\t          ],\n396\t          [\n397\t            \"14B FOLIO-60\",\n398\t            0.4,\n399\t            6.7,\n400\t            30\n401\t          ],\n402\t          [\n403\t            \"14B PW-60\",\n404\t            0.63,\n405\t            0.0,\n406\t            30\n407\t          ],\n408\t          [\n409\t            \"14B Combined-60\",\n410\t            0.53,\n411\t            3.3,\n412\t            60\n413\t          ],\n414\t          [\n415\t            \"14B FOLIO-204\",\n416\t            0.32,\n417\t            2.0,\n418\t            204\n419\t          ],\n420\t          [\n421\t            \"14B PW-600\",\n422\t            0.25,\n423\t            -0.5,\n424\t            600\n425\t          ],\n426\t          [\n427\t            \"14B Combined-804\",\n428\t            0.28,\n429\t            0.7,\n430\t            804\n431\t          ],\n432\t          [\n433\t            \"7B Combined-60\",\n434\t            0.65,\n435\t            1.7,\n436\t            60\n437\t          ],\n438\t          [\n439\t            \"14B K=6\",\n440\t            0.4,\n441\t            1.7,\n442\t            60\n443\t          ],\n444\t          [\n445\t            \"14B K=8\",\n446\t            0.45,\n447\t            0.0,\n448\t            60\n449\t          ],\n450\t          [\n451\t            \"14B K=16\",\n452\t            0.55,\n453\t            1.7,\n454\t            60\n455\t          ],\n456\t          [\n457\t            \"14B K=20\",\n458\t            0.58,\n459\t            0.0,\n460\t            60\n461\t          ]\n462\t        ]\n463\t      }\n464\t    ],\n465\t    \"figures\": [],\n466\t    \"analysis\": \"C0 diagnostic在worst档下的贡献从\\\"practical zero-cost tool\\\"退化为 \\\"necessary condition identifier\\\"——C0<5%确实predicts gap=0（无false negatives in that range），但C0>30%不guarantee positive gap（ProofWriter反例）。 Paper framing：C0的价值是快速排除不值得尝试的场景（reasoning models）， 而非精确预测gain magnitude。这仍是有价值的practitioner insight， 但claim需要significantly weaken。\\n\\n\\n在worst档下，C0 vs gap的关系存在但不strong： - QwQ数据点（C0≈0, gap=0）锚定了左下角 - 14B-Instruct K=12 60题（C0=0.53, gap=3.3）是outlier（小样本噪声放大） - 14B-Instruct 804题（C0=0.28, gap=0.7）落在中间偏低 - 7B（C0=0.65, gap=1.7）比14B 804题高但不如14B 60题 - K ablation各点散布较广 Pearson r≈0.45说明C0解释了约20%的variance——有信号但不是strong predictor。 作为binary classifier（C0>0.3 → SICA有价值），AUC=0.72——比random好但远非 definitive。这将C0从\\\"precise diagnostic\\\"降级为\\\"rough screening heuristic\\\"。 在worst档narrative中，这恰好支持\\\"characterization贡献\\\"而非\\\"practical tool\\\"。\\n\"\n467\t  },\n468\t  {\n469\t    \"name\": \"sica_72b_awq\",\n470\t    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-72B-Instruct AWQ 4-bit on 60 questions, K=12, T=0.7\",\n471\t    \"results\": {\n472\t      \"sc_accuracy\": 0.783,\n473\t      \"sica_accuracy\": 0.783,\n474\t      \"sica_sc_gap_pp\": 0.0,\n475\t      \"c0_multi_candidate_rate\": 0.18,\n476\t      \"tie_fraction\": 0.017,\n477\t      \"maxsat_exclusion_rate\": 0.015,\n478\t      \"constraint_quality_score\": 0.82,\n479\t      \"wall_time_hours\": 3.5\n480\t    },\n481\t    \"tables\": [\n482\t      {\n483\t        \"name\": \"Table 5 (extended): Full Model Scaling\",\n484\t        \"columns\": [\n485\t          \"Model\",\n486\t          \"Params\",\n487\t          \"Type\",\n488\t          \"SC Acc\",\n489\t          \"C0\",\n490\t          \"Gap (pp)\"\n491\t        ],\n492\t        \"rows\": [\n493\t          [\n494\t            \"Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct\",\n495\t            \"7B\",\n496\t            \"Instruction\",\n497\t            \"58.3%\",\n498\t            \"0.65\",\n499\t            \"+1.7\"\n500\t          ],\n501\t          [\n502\t            \"Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct\",\n503\t            \"14B\",\n504\t            \"Instruction\",\n505\t            \"70.0%\",\n506\t            \"0.53\",\n507\t            \"+3.3\"\n508\t          ],\n509\t          [\n510\t            \"Qwen2.5-72B-Instruct-AWQ\",\n511\t            \"72B\",\n512\t            \"Instruction\",\n513\t            \"78.3%\",\n514\t            \"0.18\",\n515\t            \"0.0\"\n516\t          ],\n517\t          [\n518\t            \"QwQ-32B\",\n519\t            \"32B\",\n520\t            \"Reasoning\",\n521\t            \"72.7%\",\n522\t            \"0.036\",\n523\t            \"0.0\"\n524\t          ]\n525\t        ]\n526\t      }\n527\t    ],\n528\t    \"figures\": [],\n529\t    \"analysis\": \"72B结果在worst档下是devastating for accuracy claim但excellent for characterization： 它证明SICA的operating regime不仅排除reasoning models，还排除sufficiently capable instruction models。实际有效的窗口是\\\"14B-class instruction models on specific  diverse-inducing tasks\\\"——一个非常narrow的niche。 对reframed paper：这是operating regime分析的crown jewel数据点， 证明了regime narrowness是model capability的函数而非architecture的binary。\\n\\n\\n72B模型在worst档下表现接近reasoning model regime： 更强的instruction model更self-consistent（虽非reasoning architecture， 但72B的internal representation足够强大以produce near-deterministic outputs）。 C0=18%接近worst档定义的lower bound，tie fraction仅1题（1.7%）。 高constraint quality（0.82）但无用武之地——当多数题12/12一致时， 即使constraints完美也无法改变outcome。Gap=0pp。 这对paper的贡献：在7B-14B-72B-QwQ的spectrum上， 展示了C0与model capability的inverse relationship不限于reasoning vs instruction的 binary divide，而是continuous spectrum。72B是\\\"instruction model approaching  reasoning model regime\\\"的evidence。\\n\"\n530\t  },\n531\t  {\n532\t    \"name\": \"constraint_quality_case_studies\",\n533\t    \"description\": \"Qualitative analysis of extracted constraints on 5-10 representative questions\",\n534\t    \"results\": {\n535\t      \"semantically_meaningful_rate\": 0.55,\n536\t      \"trivially_correct_rate\": 0.3,\n537\t      \"malformed_or_vacuous_rate\": 0.15,\n538\t      \"exclusion_justified_rate\": 0.7,\n539\t      \"case_study_n\": 8,\n540\t      \"finding\": \"Constraints are often restatements of the answer rather than independent logical evidence\"\n541\t    },\n542\t    \"tables\": [],\n543\t    \"figures\": [],\n544\t    \"analysis\": \"Case studies在worst档下支持一个deep methodological critique： current constraint extraction paradigm produces answer-local evidence而非 cross-answer comparative evidence。这不是implementation bug而是architectural limitation——LLM traces naturally argue FOR their conclusion而非AGAINST alternatives。 对reframed paper：这是\\\"why symbolic consensus fails\\\"的mechanistic explanation， 升级为Section 5的核心内容。\\n\\n\\n在worst档下，constraint quality analysis揭示了SICA的deeper limitation： 多数extracted constraints不是独立于answer的logical evidence，而是answer的 reformulation（\\\"if answer is A then X holds\\\" → tautological when answer IS A）。 真正的inter-answer constraints（\\\"A and B cannot both be true because...\\\"）占少数。 MaxSAT exclusion（当它发生时）确实对应reasoning errors（70% justified）， 但exclusion rate太低（2-3%）说明大多数constraints不互相矛盾—— 它们各自支持自己的answer而不cross-reference other candidates。 这解释了为什么MaxSAT在非tie场景无法翻转majority：constraints是answer-local的， 不提供cross-answer的discriminative信号。\\n\"\n545\t  },\n546\t  {\n547\t    \"name\": \"overhead_analysis\",\n548\t    \"description\": \"Wall-time breakdown per question: generation, extraction, MaxSAT\",\n549\t    \"results\": {\n550\t      \"avg_total_time_per_question_s\": 58.3,\n551\t      \"generation_fraction\": 0.85,\n552\t      \"extraction_fraction\": 0.12,\n553\t      \"maxsat_fraction\": 0.03,\n554\t      \"overhead_vs_sc_multiplier\": 1.15,\n555\t      \"extraction_api_calls_per_question\": 12,\n556\t      \"maxsat_solve_time_ms\": 45,\n557\t      \"overall_cost_multiplier_vs_sc\": 2.2\n558\t    },\n559\t    \"tables\": [\n560\t      {\n561\t        \"name\": \"Table 8: Computational Overhead Breakdown\",\n562\t        \"columns\": [\n563\t          \"Stage\",\n564\t          \"Avg Time (s)\",\n565\t          \"Fraction\",\n566\t          \"Cost vs SC\"\n567\t        ],\n568\t        \"rows\": [\n569\t          [\n570\t            \"Generation (K=12 traces)\",\n571\t            49.5,\n572\t            \"85%\",\n573\t            \"1.0x (same as SC)\"\n574\t          ],\n575\t          [\n576\t            \"Constraint Extraction\",\n577\t            7.0,\n578\t            \"12%\",\n579\t            \"+1.0x (12 LLM calls)\"\n580\t          ],\n581\t          [\n582\t            \"MaxSAT Solving\",\n583\t            1.8,\n584\t            \"3%\",\n585\t            \"negligible\"\n586\t          ],\n587\t          [\n588\t            \"Total SICA\",\n589\t            58.3,\n590\t            \"100%\",\n591\t            \"2.2x vs SC\"\n592\t          ]\n593\t        ]\n594\t      }\n595\t    ],\n596\t    \"figures\": [],\n597\t    \"analysis\": \"Overhead结果在worst档下的silver lining：MaxSAT本身几乎free（45ms）， bottleneck完全在constraint extraction的LLM calls。 这为future work开路：如果extraction可以更高效（batch, smaller model,  或integrated into generation prompt），SICA的marginal cost可降至接近零。 对reframed paper：overhead不是致命弱点（不像some symbolic methods需要 exponential time），而是engineering problem。主要weakness仍是regime narrowness， 不是computational cost。\\n\\nOverhead analysis在worst档下呈现矛盾narrative： computational overhead其实不大（MaxSAT本身仅3%的时间）， 主要cost是constraint extraction的额外LLM calls（每题12次extraction call， 约等于generation cost×1）。总cost是SC的2.2倍。 在gain=0.7pp且不显著的情况下，任何>1x的overhead都是cost-ineffective的。 但如果reframe为diagnostic tool，overhead的framing变化： \\\"C0 computation需要0 overhead（只看SC投票分布）， full SICA pipeline的overhead仅在C0>threshold时才值得incur\\\"。 这支持了two-stage deployment strategy的practical recommendation。\\n\"\n598\t  }\n599\t]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5d4d05df-e774-4096-8b7e-576c0487978c","uuid":"63df72fc-2b68-4607-8017-6084ed924e2c","timestamp":"2026-05-16T06:10:35.645Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0513_3/projects/symb_invariant_consensus/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260516T054054/worst/experiment_data.json","content":"[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"sica_expanded_14b\",\n    \"description\": \"PW D5 600 + FOLIO 204 = 804 questions, K=12, T=0.7, Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"sica_accuracy_combined\": 0.695,\n      \"sc_accuracy_combined\": 0.688,\n      \"sica_sc_gap_combined_pp\": 0.7,\n      \"folio_sica_accuracy\": 0.755,\n      \"folio_sc_accuracy\": 0.735,\n      \"folio_gap_pp\": 2.0,\n      \"proofwriter_sica_accuracy\": 0.665,\n      \"proofwriter_sc_accuracy\": 0.67,\n      \"proofwriter_gap_pp\": -0.5,\n      \"bootstrap_p_combined\": 0.32,\n      \"bootstrap_p_folio\": 0.18,\n      \"c0_combined\": 0.28,\n      \"c0_folio\": 0.32,\n      \"c0_proofwriter\": 0.25,\n      \"maxsat_exclusion_rate\": 0.022,\n      \"tie_question_fraction\": 0.025,\n      \"tiebreak_triggered_n\": \"~20\",\n      \"tiebreak_win_rate\": 0.6,\n      \"wall_time_hours\": \"~13\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 2: Expanded Results (804 Questions)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Domain\",\n          \"N\",\n          \"SC Acc\",\n          \"SICA Acc\",\n          \"Gap (pp)\",\n          \"C0\",\n          \"Ties\",\n          \"p-value\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"FOLIO\",\n            204,\n            \"73.5%\",\n            \"75.5%\",\n            \"+2.0\",\n            \"0.32\",\n            \"6 (2.9%)\",\n            \"0.18\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"ProofWriter D5\",\n            600,\n            \"67.0%\",\n            \"66.5%\",\n            \"-0.5\",\n            \"0.25\",\n            \"14 (2.3%)\",\n            \"0.71\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Combined\",\n            804,\n            \"68.8%\",\n            \"69.5%\",\n            \"+0.7\",\n            \"0.28\",\n            \"20 (2.5%)\",\n            \"0.32\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"D012 (reference)\",\n            60,\n            \"70.0%\",\n            \"73.3%\",\n            \"+3.3\",\n            \"0.53\",\n            \"4 (6.7%)\",\n            \"0.23\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"关键发现：60题D012样本的C0=53%是selection bias——那60题本身就是从pilot中挑出的 有趣/困难题目。扩展到完整benchmark后，绝大多数题对14B-Instruct而言diversity不足。 SICA的正确性在tie scenario中得到验证（60% win rate > 25% random baseline）， 但tie场景太少（2.5%）导致aggregate gain不显著。 这直接支持reframe：方法正确但operating regime狭窄。\\n\\n\\n60题的C0=53%严重高估了总体diversity。扩展至804题后，大量ProofWriter D5题目对14B而言 要么太简单（12/12一致正确）要么模式化错误（12/12一致错误），C0降至25-28%。 FOLIO 204题中约32%有多候选，但多数多候选题的split是9:3或10:2而非6:6， MaxSAT在非tie情况下几乎不改变majority结果（exclusion rate仅2.2%）。 真正的6:6 tie在K=12下约占2.5%（~20题），tiebreak在这20题上win rate约60%， 贡献约0.7pp的combined gap。ProofWriter因其closed-world逻辑的规律性， 14B在大样本上反而因constraint extraction引入微量噪声导致-0.5pp。 Bootstrap p=0.32远未达显著性，confirm了小样本噪声假设。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"sica_k_ablation_14b\",\n    \"description\": \"K=6,8,12,16,20 on D012's 60 questions, T=0.7, Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"k6_gap_pp\": 1.7,\n      \"k6_c0\": 0.4,\n      \"k6_tie_fraction\": 0.033,\n      \"k8_gap_pp\": 0.0,\n      \"k8_c0\": 0.45,\n      \"k8_tie_fraction\": 0.017,\n      \"k12_gap_pp\": 3.3,\n      \"k12_c0\": 0.53,\n      \"k12_tie_fraction\": 0.067,\n      \"k16_gap_pp\": 1.7,\n      \"k16_c0\": 0.55,\n      \"k16_tie_fraction\": 0.033,\n      \"k20_gap_pp\": 0.0,\n      \"k20_c0\": 0.58,\n      \"k20_tie_fraction\": 0.017,\n      \"best_k\": 12,\n      \"best_gap_pp\": 3.3,\n      \"odd_k_gap_pp\": 0.0,\n      \"correlation_c0_gap\": 0.35\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 3: K Sensitivity Analysis\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"K\",\n          \"C0\",\n          \"Tie Fraction\",\n          \"SICA Acc\",\n          \"SC Acc\",\n          \"Gap (pp)\",\n          \"Exclusion Rate\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            6,\n            \"40%\",\n            \"3.3%\",\n            \"71.7%\",\n            \"70.0%\",\n            \"+1.7\",\n            \"2.8%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            8,\n            \"45%\",\n            \"1.7%\",\n            \"70.0%\",\n            \"70.0%\",\n            \"0.0\",\n            \"2.5%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            12,\n            \"53%\",\n            \"6.7%\",\n            \"73.3%\",\n            \"70.0%\",\n            \"+3.3\",\n            \"2.6%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            16,\n            \"55%\",\n            \"3.3%\",\n            \"71.7%\",\n            \"70.0%\",\n            \"+1.7\",\n            \"2.4%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            20,\n            \"58%\",\n            \"1.7%\",\n            \"70.0%\",\n            \"70.0%\",\n            \"0.0\",\n            \"2.2%\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"K ablation是worst档的核心evidence：它证明SICA gain完全由tie frequency决定， 而非由constraint quality或MaxSAT reasoning决定。C0和gap的相关性仅0.35， 因为C0测量的是diversity存在性，而gain需要diversity恰好50:50。 这支持reframe中的\\\"method is correct but regime is narrow\\\"论点。 Paper中应呈现为\\\"SICA's mechanism activates only at exact vote parity\\\"。\\n\\n\\nK ablation在worst档下揭示SICA gain完全是tie-driven artifact： - K=12恰好是唯一在这60题上产生较多even-split tie的值（4题=6.7%） - K=6时tie需要3:3，概率更低但发生1-2次；K=8需要4:4，几乎不发生 - K=16/20时，larger sample使majority更稳定，tie概率指数下降 - C0随K单调增加（更多samples→更可能出现minority answer），但tie fraction\\n  不单调——它取决于specific split概率\\n- 如果测试odd K（K=7,9,11），tie在majority voting下数学上不可能，gap=0 这证明SICA的gain机制是且仅是tiebreaking，没有通过constraint weighting 在非tie场景改变outcome。MaxSAT exclusion在所有K下都<3%， 从未翻转过一个non-tie majority。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"tiebreak_baseline_analysis\",\n    \"description\": \"SICA vs SC-random vs SC-deterministic on all available data (exp-001 results)\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"expanded_tie_questions_n\": 20,\n      \"sica_tiebreak_accuracy\": 0.6,\n      \"random_tiebreak_expected_accuracy\": 0.5,\n      \"alphabetical_tiebreak_accuracy\": 0.45,\n      \"first_seen_tiebreak_accuracy\": 0.4,\n      \"sica_vs_random_gap_on_ties_pp\": 10.0,\n      \"sica_vs_random_gap_overall_pp\": 0.25,\n      \"binomial_p_sica_vs_random\": 0.25\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 4: Tiebreak Strategy Comparison (Tie Questions Only)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Strategy\",\n          \"Acc on Ties (N=20)\",\n          \"Overall Acc (N=804)\",\n          \"vs Random (pp)\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"SICA (MaxSAT weighted)\",\n            \"60.0%\",\n            \"69.5%\",\n            \"+0.25\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Random (expected)\",\n            \"50.0%\",\n            \"69.3%\",\n            \"—\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Alphabetical\",\n            \"45.0%\",\n            \"69.1%\",\n            \"-0.12\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"First-seen\",\n            \"40.0%\",\n            \"69.0%\",\n            \"-0.25\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Tiebreak analysis在worst档下支撑的narrative是：SICA作为tiebreak mechanism 方向正确（优于random和deterministic），但operating regime（tie frequency=2.5%） 使其对aggregate performance的贡献可以忽略。 Paper framing：不claim accuracy gain，而是用tiebreak win rate作为 \\\"symbolic constraints carry real information\\\"的evidence，然后pivot到 \\\"but the regime where this information matters is vanishingly narrow for current models\\\"。\\n\\n\\n在expanded 804题上，tie仅~20题。SICA在这20题上60% accuracy（12/20正确）， random baseline期望50%（10/20），差距仅2题。Binomial test p=0.25（20次试验中 观察12+ success vs null=0.5），远不显著。 虽然per-tie的win rate（60%>50%）方向正确，但： (1) 样本太小无法统计确认优势 (2) 即使优势真实，对overall accuracy贡献仅0.25pp（20题×10%÷804题） Alphabetical/first-seen表现更差验证了\\\"任意tiebreak确实有害\\\"，但SICA的优势 幅度太小且统计不显著。这是\\\"correct but narrow\\\"的直接数字化呈现。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"sica_7b_scaling\",\n    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct on same 60 questions, K=12, T=0.7\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"sc_accuracy\": 0.583,\n      \"sica_accuracy\": 0.6,\n      \"sica_sc_gap_pp\": 1.7,\n      \"c0_multi_candidate_rate\": 0.65,\n      \"tie_fraction\": 0.1,\n      \"tiebreak_win_rate\": 0.5,\n      \"maxsat_exclusion_rate\": 0.018,\n      \"constraint_quality_score\": 0.45,\n      \"extraction_failure_rate\": 0.12\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 5: Model Scaling and C0\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Model\",\n          \"Params\",\n          \"SC Acc\",\n          \"C0\",\n          \"Tie%\",\n          \"Tiebreak WR\",\n          \"Gap (pp)\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"QwQ-32B\",\n            \"32B (reasoning)\",\n            \"72.7%\",\n            \"0.036\",\n            \"0%\",\n            \"N/A\",\n            \"0.0\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct\",\n            \"14B\",\n            \"70.0%\",\n            \"0.53\",\n            \"6.7%\",\n            \"75%\",\n            \"+3.3\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct\",\n            \"7B\",\n            \"58.3%\",\n            \"0.65\",\n            \"10%\",\n            \"50%\",\n            \"+1.7\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"7B结果在worst档下是double-edged：一方面验证了C0与model type的关系（weaker→more diverse）， 另一方面破坏了C0作为单一predictor的简洁narrative。需要引入constraint quality 作为second axis，使C0 diagnostic framework从\\\"单指标预测\\\"退化为\\\"必要条件判断\\\"。 对reframed paper仍有价值：强化了\\\"operating regime is narrow\\\"的结论—— 不仅需要diversity，还需要diversity来自有能力产生valid constraints的模型。\\n\\n\\n7B模型验证了C0-as-predictor的方向性（C0=65% > 14B的53%），但在worst档下 暴露了C0的insufficiency：更高的diversity不一定转化为更大的SICA gain。 原因：7B的constraint extraction质量显著下降——更弱的模型生成的reasoning traces 逻辑结构更松散，extracted FOL constraints更多是malformed或语义空洞的， MaxSAT weighting基于低质量constraints做出的决策不比random好。 Tie fraction确实更高（10% vs 6.7%），但tiebreak win rate降至chance level（50%）， 因为constraint信号被noise淹没。最终gap仅1.7pp且完全不显著。 这对paper的贡献：C0是necessary but not sufficient condition—— 还需要constraint quality（隐含model capability threshold）。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"qwq_32b_operating_regime\",\n    \"description\": \"QwQ-32B existing data formatted for operating regime analysis\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"aime_c0\": 0.0,\n      \"aime_sica_sc_gap\": 0.0,\n      \"folio_c0\": 0.0,\n      \"folio_sica_sc_gap\": 0.0,\n      \"proofwriter_c0\": 0.1875,\n      \"proofwriter_sica_sc_gap\": 0.0,\n      \"combined_c0\": 0.036,\n      \"combined_sica_sc_gap\": 0.0,\n      \"n_total\": 48,\n      \"reasoning_model_conclusion\": \"SICA structurally degenerates to SC\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 6: Reasoning vs Instruction Model Operating Regime\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Model\",\n          \"Type\",\n          \"Domain\",\n          \"N\",\n          \"C0\",\n          \"SICA-SC Gap\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"QwQ-32B\",\n            \"Reasoning\",\n            \"AIME\",\n            22,\n            \"0%\",\n            \"0.0pp\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"QwQ-32B\",\n            \"Reasoning\",\n            \"FOLIO\",\n            10,\n            \"0%\",\n            \"0.0pp\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"QwQ-32B\",\n            \"Reasoning\",\n            \"ProofWriter\",\n            16,\n            \"18.75%\",\n            \"0.0pp\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct\",\n            \"Instruction\",\n            \"FOLIO\",\n            30,\n            \"40%\",\n            \"+6.7pp\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct\",\n            \"Instruction\",\n            \"ProofWriter\",\n            30,\n            \"63%\",\n            \"0.0pp\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct\",\n            \"Instruction\",\n            \"Combined\",\n            60,\n            \"53%\",\n            \"+3.3pp\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"QwQ data在worst档下从\\\"negative result配角\\\"升为\\\"主要贡献\\\"。 Framing：不是\\\"SICA在reasoning model上失败\\\"，而是\\\"我们发现了一个fundamental architectural property——reasoning models的internal self-consistency消除了 external consensus的操作空间\\\"。这个发现对ALL ensemble/consensus methods成立， 不限于SICA，是architecturally general的insight。 Paper中应作为Section 4的opening，建立\\\"operating regime\\\"概念后再展示14B数据。\\n\\n\\nQwQ数据已存在且确认worst档预设：reasoning model的chain-of-thought过程 产生near-deterministic答案（temperature sampling无法穿透reasoning chain的 self-correction机制）。C0=3.6%意味着在48题中仅1-2题出现过多候选答案， 且这些多候选情况可能是reasoning chain的中间犹豫而非genuine uncertainty。 SICA≡SC是数学必然：当只有1个candidate answer时，MaxSAT无论怎么weight都选它。 这是worst档narrative的strongest evidence——\\\"method correctness is irrelevant  when the operating regime doesn't exist\\\"。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"c0_diagnostic_validation\",\n    \"description\": \"Plot C0 vs SICA-SC gap across all models and K values\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n_datapoints\": 12,\n      \"pearson_r_c0_gap\": 0.45,\n      \"spearman_rho_c0_gap\": 0.52,\n      \"c0_threshold_for_positive_gap\": 0.3,\n      \"false_positive_rate\": 0.25,\n      \"false_negative_rate\": 0.1,\n      \"auc_c0_as_classifier\": 0.72\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 7: C0 as Diagnostic — Correlation Analysis\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Condition\",\n          \"C0\",\n          \"Gap (pp)\",\n          \"N\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"QwQ-32B Combined\",\n            0.036,\n            0.0,\n            48\n          ],\n          [\n            \"14B FOLIO-60\",\n            0.4,\n            6.7,\n            30\n          ],\n          [\n            \"14B PW-60\",\n            0.63,\n            0.0,\n            30\n          ],\n          [\n            \"14B Combined-60\",\n            0.53,\n            3.3,\n            60\n          ],\n          [\n            \"14B FOLIO-204\",\n            0.32,\n            2.0,\n            204\n          ],\n          [\n            \"14B PW-600\",\n            0.25,\n            -0.5,\n            600\n          ],\n          [\n            \"14B Combined-804\",\n            0.28,\n            0.7,\n            804\n          ],\n          [\n            \"7B Combined-60\",\n            0.65,\n            1.7,\n            60\n          ],\n          [\n            \"14B K=6\",\n            0.4,\n            1.7,\n            60\n          ],\n          [\n            \"14B K=8\",\n            0.45,\n            0.0,\n            60\n          ],\n          [\n            \"14B K=16\",\n            0.55,\n            1.7,\n            60\n          ],\n          [\n            \"14B K=20\",\n            0.58,\n            0.0,\n            60\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"C0 diagnostic在worst档下的贡献从\\\"practical zero-cost tool\\\"退化为 \\\"necessary condition identifier\\\"——C0<5%确实predicts gap=0（无false negatives in that range），但C0>30%不guarantee positive gap（ProofWriter反例）。 Paper framing：C0的价值是快速排除不值得尝试的场景（reasoning models）， 而非精确预测gain magnitude。这仍是有价值的practitioner insight， 但claim需要significantly weaken。\\n\\n\\n在worst档下，C0 vs gap的关系存在但不strong： - QwQ数据点（C0≈0, gap=0）锚定了左下角 - 14B-Instruct K=12 60题（C0=0.53, gap=3.3）是outlier（小样本噪声放大） - 14B-Instruct 804题（C0=0.28, gap=0.7）落在中间偏低 - 7B（C0=0.65, gap=1.7）比14B 804题高但不如14B 60题 - K ablation各点散布较广 Pearson r≈0.45说明C0解释了约20%的variance——有信号但不是strong predictor。 作为binary classifier（C0>0.3 → SICA有价值），AUC=0.72——比random好但远非 definitive。这将C0从\\\"precise diagnostic\\\"降级为\\\"rough screening heuristic\\\"。 在worst档narrative中，这恰好支持\\\"characterization贡献\\\"而非\\\"practical tool\\\"。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"sica_72b_awq\",\n    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-72B-Instruct AWQ 4-bit on 60 questions, K=12, T=0.7\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"sc_accuracy\": 0.783,\n      \"sica_accuracy\": 0.783,\n      \"sica_sc_gap_pp\": 0.0,\n      \"c0_multi_candidate_rate\": 0.18,\n      \"tie_fraction\": 0.017,\n      \"maxsat_exclusion_rate\": 0.015,\n      \"constraint_quality_score\": 0.82,\n      \"wall_time_hours\": 3.5\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 5 (extended): Full Model Scaling\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Model\",\n          \"Params\",\n          \"Type\",\n          \"SC Acc\",\n          \"C0\",\n          \"Gap (pp)\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct\",\n            \"7B\",\n            \"Instruction\",\n            \"58.3%\",\n            \"0.65\",\n            \"+1.7\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct\",\n            \"14B\",\n            \"Instruction\",\n            \"70.0%\",\n            \"0.53\",\n            \"+3.3\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen2.5-72B-Instruct-AWQ\",\n            \"72B\",\n            \"Instruction\",\n            \"78.3%\",\n            \"0.18\",\n            \"0.0\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"QwQ-32B\",\n            \"32B\",\n            \"Reasoning\",\n            \"72.7%\",\n            \"0.036\",\n            \"0.0\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"72B结果在worst档下是devastating for accuracy claim但excellent for characterization： 它证明SICA的operating regime不仅排除reasoning models，还排除sufficiently capable instruction models。实际有效的窗口是\\\"14B-class instruction models on specific  diverse-inducing tasks\\\"——一个非常narrow的niche。 对reframed paper：这是operating regime分析的crown jewel数据点， 证明了regime narrowness是model capability的函数而非architecture的binary。\\n\\n\\n72B模型在worst档下表现接近reasoning model regime： 更强的instruction model更self-consistent（虽非reasoning architecture， 但72B的internal representation足够强大以produce near-deterministic outputs）。 C0=18%接近worst档定义的lower bound，tie fraction仅1题（1.7%）。 高constraint quality（0.82）但无用武之地——当多数题12/12一致时， 即使constraints完美也无法改变outcome。Gap=0pp。 这对paper的贡献：在7B-14B-72B-QwQ的spectrum上， 展示了C0与model capability的inverse relationship不限于reasoning vs instruction的 binary divide，而是continuous spectrum。72B是\\\"instruction model approaching  reasoning model regime\\\"的evidence。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"constraint_quality_case_studies\",\n    \"description\": \"Qualitative analysis of extracted constraints on 5-10 representative questions\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"semantically_meaningful_rate\": 0.55,\n      \"trivially_correct_rate\": 0.3,\n      \"malformed_or_vacuous_rate\": 0.15,\n      \"exclusion_justified_rate\": 0.7,\n      \"case_study_n\": 8,\n      \"finding\": \"Constraints are often restatements of the answer rather than independent logical evidence\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Case studies在worst档下支持一个deep methodological critique： current constraint extraction paradigm produces answer-local evidence而非 cross-answer comparative evidence。这不是implementation bug而是architectural limitation——LLM traces naturally argue FOR their conclusion而非AGAINST alternatives。 对reframed paper：这是\\\"why symbolic consensus fails\\\"的mechanistic explanation， 升级为Section 5的核心内容。\\n\\n\\n在worst档下，constraint quality analysis揭示了SICA的deeper limitation： 多数extracted constraints不是独立于answer的logical evidence，而是answer的 reformulation（\\\"if answer is A then X holds\\\" → tautological when answer IS A）。 真正的inter-answer constraints（\\\"A and B cannot both be true because...\\\"）占少数。 MaxSAT exclusion（当它发生时）确实对应reasoning errors（70% justified）， 但exclusion rate太低（2-3%）说明大多数constraints不互相矛盾—— 它们各自支持自己的answer而不cross-reference other candidates。 这解释了为什么MaxSAT在非tie场景无法翻转majority：constraints是answer-local的， 不提供cross-answer的discriminative信号。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"overhead_analysis\",\n    \"description\": \"Wall-time breakdown per question: generation, extraction, MaxSAT\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"avg_total_time_per_question_s\": 58.3,\n      \"generation_fraction\": 0.85,\n      \"extraction_fraction\": 0.12,\n      \"maxsat_fraction\": 0.03,\n      \"overhead_vs_sc_multiplier\": 1.15,\n      \"extraction_api_calls_per_question\": 12,\n      \"maxsat_solve_time_ms\": 45,\n      \"overall_cost_multiplier_vs_sc\": 2.2\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 8: Computational Overhead Breakdown\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Stage\",\n          \"Avg Time (s)\",\n          \"Fraction\",\n          \"Cost vs SC\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Generation (K=12 traces)\",\n            49.5,\n            \"85%\",\n            \"1.0x (same as SC)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Constraint Extraction\",\n            7.0,\n            \"12%\",\n            \"+1.0x (12 LLM calls)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"MaxSAT Solving\",\n            1.8,\n            \"3%\",\n            \"negligible\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Total SICA\",\n            58.3,\n            \"100%\",\n            \"2.2x vs SC\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Overhead结果在worst档下的silver lining：MaxSAT本身几乎free（45ms）， bottleneck完全在constraint extraction的LLM calls。 这为future work开路：如果extraction可以更高效（batch, smaller model,  或integrated into generation prompt），SICA的marginal cost可降至接近零。 对reframed paper：overhead不是致命弱点（不像some symbolic methods需要 exponential time），而是engineering problem。主要weakness仍是regime narrowness， 不是computational cost。\\n\\nOverhead analysis在worst档下呈现矛盾narrative： computational overhead其实不大（MaxSAT本身仅3%的时间）， 主要cost是constraint extraction的额外LLM calls（每题12次extraction call， 约等于generation cost×1）。总cost是SC的2.2倍。 在gain=0.7pp且不显著的情况下，任何>1x的overhead都是cost-ineffective的。 但如果reframe为diagnostic tool，overhead的framing变化： \\\"C0 computation需要0 overhead（只看SC投票分布）， full SICA pipeline的overhead仅在C0>threshold时才值得incur\\\"。 这支持了two-stage deployment strategy的practical recommendation。\\n\"\n  }\n]","numLines":599,"startLine":1,"totalLines":599}}}
